Wedding Budget Calculator: A $30,000 Budget by Category

Here's how a $30,000 wedding budget splits:
• venue and catering: $13,500;
• photo and video: $3,600;
• flowers and décor: $3,000;
• music: $2,400;
• attire and beauty: $2,100;
• rings, cake and stationery: the rest;
• an 11% buffer for the costs couples forget.

With 100 guests, that's $300 per guest. Type in your own total and guest count with the free calculator.

